[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0036","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0036.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0087","title":"Itetris Itetris/xitetris 本地提权漏洞","description":"Itetris 1.6.1/1.6.2 版本中存在危险的命令执行漏洞。该游戏在运行时会信任 PATH 环境变量来查找并执行 gunzip 程序，而非使用绝对路径调用系统程序。本地攻击者可通过修改 PATH 环境变量，将其指向自行构造的恶意 gunzip 可执行文件，当 Itetris 以 root 权限运行时（如设置了 setuid 位），该恶意程序将继承高权限执行，从而造成本地权限提升，攻击者可完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0087"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:37.890","remediation":"升级 itetris 到 1.6.3 或更高版本（若已不再维护，建议卸载该软件包）。如无法升级，可移除 itetris 二进制文件的 setuid 权限位（chmod u-s /usr/games/itetris），并将 gunzip 调用改为绝对路径 /usr/bin/gunzip 以防止 PATH 劫持攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0295.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2139","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5795","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20517","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0087.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0087","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0087.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0087.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3x4g-qr6f-2pmw/GHSA-3x4g-qr6f-2pmw.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2139/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0087.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0036.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0035","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0035.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0084","title":"GTK+ 1.2.8 任意可加载模块执行本地权限提升漏洞","description":"GTK+ 库 1.2.8 及之前版本中存在任意可加载模块执行漏洞。该漏洞源于 GTK+ 库在处理 GTK_MODULES 环境变量时未进行有效限制，本地用户可通过设置恶意的 GTK_MODULES 环境变量，在被 setuid/setgid 程序加载 GTK+ 库时，导致程序加载并执行攻击者指定的任意共享模块，从而实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响使用 GTK+ 1.2.8 的各类 Linux/Unix 系统，攻击者必须具备本地用户权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0084"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:37.553","remediation":"禁止将 GTK+ 用于 setuid/setgid 程序，GTK 官方已声明不会修复此问题。正确的架构方案是将程序拆分为：一个最小化的 setuid 后端（通过管道/Unix socket 与 GUI 通信）和一个非特权的前端 GUI 进程。临时缓解措施可在启动 setuid 程序前执行 `unset GTK_MODULES` 以消除模块注入风险，或升级至 GTK+ 2.x/3.x 版本（尽管官方同样不保障 setuid 安全性）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0498.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0027.html","http://www.gtk.org/setuid.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2165","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20526","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0084.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0084","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0084.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0084.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7gg7-9cpw-h9r9/GHSA-7gg7-9cpw-h9r9.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_0_100.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0084.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e3a51276-753e-4f15-9759-517323dfd67c.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0035.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0033","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0080","title":"Cisco Catalyst 4000/5000/6000 交换机 SSH 协议不匹配拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco Catalyst 4000/5000/6000 系列交换机 SSH 服务存在协议不匹配拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过使用非 SSH 客户端连接目标设备的 SSH 服务，触发协议协商错误，导致设备异常拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 6.1 版本软件的 Cisco Catalyst 系列交换机，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。目前厂商已发布相关安全建议，建议用户升级至修复版本或采取访问控制措施缓解风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0080"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:37.117","remediation":"建议将 Cisco Catalyst 交换机系统软件升级至 CatOS 6.2 及以上版本，该版本已修复 SSH 协议不匹配导致的拒绝服务问题。若无法立即升级，可在交换机上配置 ACL 限制 SSH 服务的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理网段连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/catalyst-ssh-protocolmismatch-pub.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2117","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5760","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20509","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2001/CVE-2001-0080.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0080.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0080","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0080.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0080.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wmwf-3w9p-w4cj/GHSA-wmwf-3w9p-w4cj.json","https://github.com/Hepburnsunsir/poc-/blob/3303182f1e0caa3228cb2b3ce8cd9147b237c5b7/routersploit/routersploit/modules/exploits/routers/cisco/CVE-2001-0080-pl.py","https://github.com/arpitn30/nipper-ng/blob/a344e58392d528c168b74ccda5caa309923fff56/0.11.10/common/report-vulns.c","https://github.com/scipag/AttackToolKit/blob/78bf88564956b8f18a37659dc3d345093e95a136/plugins/SSH%20server%20protocol%20mismatch%20detection.plugin"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0032","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0032.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0075","title":"Technote Technote 2000/2001 main.cgi 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Technote 2000/2001 的 main.cgi 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过在 filename 参数中注入 ../ 序列实现目录跳转，进而读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞根源在于程序未对用户输入的路径参数进行过滤和校验，可能导致敏感信息泄露甚至命令执行。受影响版本为 Technote 2000/2001，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0075"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:36.560","remediation":"建议立即升级 Technote 至最新版本或应用厂商提供的安全补丁。若无法升级，在 Web 服务器层（如 Apache/Nginx）配置 WAF 规则，对 main.cgi 的 filename 参数进行路径过滤，禁止包含 \"../\"、\"..\\\" 等目录遍历序列。同时建议限制 Web 应用运行账户对敏感系统目录的读取权限，并迁移至已维护的替代产品。由于 Technote 已停止维护，长远方案是迁移至仍在安全更新的知识库系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/153212","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2156","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20523","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0075.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0075","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0075.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0075.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9q3h-6h4j-523q/GHSA-9q3h-6h4j-523q.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/T/technote.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.1070","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0032.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0031","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0031.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0074","title":"Technote 2000/2001 print.cgi 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Technote 的 print.cgi 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 board 参数传入 `../` 等路径穿越序列，绕过访问限制读取服务器上的任意文件。攻击无需身份认证，仅需向目标 Web 服务发送特制 HTTP 请求即可触发。该漏洞可导致敏感信息泄露，影响运行 Technote 2000/2001 版本的系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0074"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:36.450","remediation":"建议立即升级 Technote 至官方最新版本，或完全移除 print.cgi 脚本。作为临时缓解措施，可在 Web 服务器层（如 Apache 的 mod_rewrite）拦截包含 `..` 路径遍历特征的请求，或限制对 print.cgi 的访问来源 IP。如该软件已停止维护，建议迁移至更安全的替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/153007","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2155","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20522","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0074.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0074","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0074.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0074.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fp6p-43fg-5cj5/GHSA-fp6p-43fg-5cj5.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0074.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--613bbe70-cd16-41f1-8c39-275458723554.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0031.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0031.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0031.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0029","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0029.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0059","title":"Sun Solaris patchadd 竞争条件漏洞","description":"Solaris 操作系统中的 patchadd 工具存在竞争条件漏洞，攻击者可在目标系统上拥有本地账户权限的情况下，利用符号链接攻击（symlink attack）在 patchadd 执行过程中劫持临时文件，从而导致任意文件覆写。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.5.1/2.6/7.0/8 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 6.2，危害等级中等。攻击者通过预测或等待 patchadd 创建临时文件的时间窗口，将符号链接指向系统关键文件，实现提权或破坏系统完整性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0059"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:34.720","remediation":"升级到 Solaris 9 或更高版本，该问题已在后续版本中修复。对于仍运行 Solaris 8 的系统，安装 Sun 官方补丁编号 108434 或更高版本。限制普通用户对 /usr/bin/patchadd 的执行权限，仅允许 root 用户执行系统补丁操作。使用 Solaris 的 RBAC（基于角色的访问控制）严格管理补丁工具的调用权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97720205217707&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2127","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5789","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20514","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0059.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0059","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0059.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0059.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9v82-8g5x-9fg5/GHSA-9v82-8g5x-9fg5.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0059.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/deshalit/async_prog/blob/2a58e64a10a9fe3859356f4b80fc7f40a4683d0c/08/app/startup_db.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0027","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0053","title":"BSD ftpd 单字节缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"BSD 系列操作系统自带的 ftpd 服务在 replydirname 函数中存在单字节缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标 FTP 服务器发送特制的目录路径请求触发该漏洞，导致单字节越界写入，进而造成内存损坏和任意代码执行，最终可获取目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响 BSD ftpd 0.3.2 及 OpenBSD ftpd 2.6/2.7 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0053"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:34.030","remediation":"对于 OpenBSD 系统，立即升级至 OpenBSD 2.8 及以上版本，该漏洞已在 OpenBSD 2.8 发布时通过修补 ftpd 的 replydirname 函数边界检查逻辑修复。对于其他 BSD 变种运行的 ftpd 0.3.2，升级至 BSD ftpd 0.3.3 或更高版本；如无法升级，在 inetd.conf 中注释 ftp 行并重启 inetd 以禁用 FTP 服务作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0275.html","http://www.openbsd.org/advisories/ftpd_replydirname.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2124","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5776","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20512","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0053.json","https://github.com/nmap/nmap/blob/817dc4df9ef999a9f1bfe076750ebae15be898d0/nselib/vulns.lua","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0053","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0053.md","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/339.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0053.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-286p-cf2h-fc7g/GHSA-286p-cf2h-fc7g.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/1e259307452fa6083f86403d8e77caee7006ff5d/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/deleted.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0027.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0015","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0029","title":"oops WWW proxy server 堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Oops! WWW 代理服务器 1.4.6 及可能其他版本存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者通过控制反向 DNS 查询结果，向服务器返回超长的主机名或域名，触发堆缓冲区溢出，从而可执行任意命令。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，无需认证即可远程利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0029"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:31.220","remediation":"建议立即升级 oops proxy server 至 1.4.7 或更高修复版本；若项目已停止维护，建议迁移至 Squid、HAProxy 等仍在活跃维护的代理服务器产品。临时缓解措施：在 oops 配置中禁用 reverse DNS lookup 功能（如有相关选项），同时在网络层通过 iptables 限制仅信任源可访问代理端口（默认 8080），降低被远程利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0158.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2099","http://zipper.paco.net/~igor/oops/ChangeLog","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6122","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/228","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0029.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0029","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2001-0029.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0029.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c5rg-f3hx-6hcg/GHSA-c5rg-f3hx-6hcg.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/O/oops_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0029.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0014","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0028","title":"Oops Proxy Server 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"oops WWW Proxy Server 1.5.2 及更早版本的 HTML 解析代码中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标代理服务器发送包含大量双引号（\"）字符的特制 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出并实现任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 oops Proxy Server 1.5.2 及之前所有版本，无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0028"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:31.100","remediation":"该漏洞已由厂商在 Oops Proxy Server 1.5.3 及以上版本中修复，建议立即升级至最新版本。若厂商已停止维护，应迁移至 Squid、HAProxy 等仍在积极维护的代理服务器软件。临时缓解措施包括：在防火墙上限制仅受信任 IP 可访问代理端口（默认 1080/tcp），并在反向代理或 WAF 层对 HTTP 请求中过多的引号字符进行过滤或截断，以防止触发缓冲区溢出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0127.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-12/0418.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2099","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5725","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20495","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0028.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0028","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2001-0028.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0028.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g5cf-8f24-p3pm/GHSA-g5cf-8f24-p3pm.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d2f6d372-2fcf-42b7-84aa-3533890b4a8d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0014.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0013","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0026","title":"Roaring Penguin rp-pppoe 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Roaring Penguin rp-pppoe PPPoE 客户端在处理 Clamp MSS 选项时存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含零长度 TCP 选项的恶意 TCP 数据包，触发 rp-pppoe 客户端在处理 MSS 钳制时发生异常，导致 PPPoE 连接中断或客户端崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 rp-pppoe 2.4 及更早版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0026"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:30.870","remediation":"升级 rp-pppoe 至 2.4 或更高版本。Red Hat Linux 7.0 用户安装 RHSA-2000-130 提供的更新包；Mandrake Linux 用户安装 MDKSA-2000-084 更新。临时缓解措施可在 PPPoE 配置中禁用 Clamp MSS 选项（注释掉 /etc/ppp/pppoe.conf 中 clamp-mss 相关行）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0134.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000357","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-084.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-130.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2098","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5727","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20494","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0026.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0026","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0026.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0026.json","https://github.com/github/