urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0009","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0022","title":"Leif M. Wright simplestguest.cgi 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"simplestguest.cgi 是由 Leif Wright 开发的 CGI 留言簿程序，其 guestbook 参数未对用户输入进行有效过滤，远程攻击者可通过在参数中插入 shell 元字符（如 |、;、` 等）执行任意系统命令，导致远程命令执行漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0022"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:30.413","remediation":"建议立即删除或禁用服务器上的 simplestguest.cgi 脚本（该程序已停止维护）。如需替代方案，可部署 Serendipity 或 WordPress 等现代留言板程序。如必须保留功能，应在 CGI 代码中对所有用户输入调用 escapeshellarg() 函数或使用正则过滤 `;&|` 等 shell 元字符后重新编译部署。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0168.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2106","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5743","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20506","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b149e946381b5dfe67f5c76cee65997e05f3a01/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0022.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0022","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2001-0022.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0022.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w3c8-c6wv-46cf/GHSA-w3c8-c6wv-46cf.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/dangerous_cgis.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0022.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2106/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0009.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0009.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0007","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0010","title":"ISC BIND 8 TSIG 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ISC BIND 8 的 TSIG（事务签名）处理代码存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标 DNS 服务器发送特制的 TSIG 请求数据包触发栈溢出，导致拒绝服务或远程代码执行，获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 BIND 8.2.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前已存在公开利用代码（ExploitDB ID: 280），建议立即升级至 BIND 9 或更高版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0010"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:29.060","remediation":"立即升级 BIND 至 8.2.2-p7 或 9.1.0 以上版本，该漏洞已在 BIND 8.2.2-p3 及后续补丁中修复。如无法升级，可在 named.conf 中禁用 TSIG 事务签名（options { tkey-gssapi-credential \"\"; }），并在边界防火墙上限制 DNS 服务仅对可信源开放。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-02.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-026","http://www.nai.com/research/covert/advisories/047.asp","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-007.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2302","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/280","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0010.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2